    "description": "Next to Grand Anse Beach, this upscale resort is 5 km from both Fort George and Maurice Bishop International Airport.\nFeaturing private balconies or terraces, the bright, modern rooms provide flat-screen TVs, free Wi-Fi, and tea and coffeemakers. Suites add beach views, whirlpool tubs and living areas. Room service is available.\nBreakfast (an extra charge) is served in a casual restaurant. There's also a poolside grill eatery and a relaxed bar. Other amenities include direct beach access, a gym and a dive center, as well as a spa, and an outdoor pool that has a waterfall and a swim-up bar."
